x652 text "There are no loops in the body of a function. Repetition is fold and loop over an earlier function: the step function receives the state, the index, and any extra arguments, and returns the next state. loop adds a predicate function that is checked before each iteration. Because n is a literal, every iteration count is known before the program runs."
