x747 puts x745 x746
x748 call close x747 
x749 call close x748 
x750 call close x749 
x751 call open x750 13
x752 write x751 4
x753 write x752 1
x754 text "diagnostics"
x755 puts x753 x754
x756 call open x755 11
x757 write x756 2
x758 text "Diagnostics"
x759 puts x757 x758
x760 call close x759 
x761 call open x760 2
x762 write x761 2
x763 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x764 puts x762 x763
x765 call close x764 
x766 call close x765 
ret x766
end

